From 3406c4fa54125bd4c4c38a024bc95a31fc87d1ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Night-Traders-Dev <jacob@night-traders.dev>
Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 19:27:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: security, dedup, routing, and validation issues (v1.5.1)

Security:
- Add is_safe_path() validation for all metadata-provided file paths,
  blocking path-traversal and shell metacharacter injection from malicious packages
- Wrap all shell-constructed paths in single quotes in _sys.exec() calls
- cmd_remove now resolves full paths via readlink -f and verifies they are
  under the expected PKGS_DIR before running rm -rf

Logic fixes:
- Replace hardcoded '1.1.2' self-update fallback with SAGEPKG_VERSION constant
- Fix duplicate sagepkg update entries in cmd_update bootstrap check
- Replace shared static TEMP_FILE with PID-scoped path to eliminate
  race conditions between concurrent sagepkg invocations
- Extra-binary wrappers now inject the binary name as args[2] so main.sage
  can route by command rather than by fragile basename-of-script-path

Package fixes:
- SageUtils: rewrite main() routing to consume injected command at args[2];
  fixes broken dispatch when invoked through sagepkg-generated wrappers
- SageFetch: add full ARM CPU part-number lookup table (Cortex-A35..X4,
  Qualcomm Kryo, Apple Silicon) replacing raw 'ARM Part 0xNNN' fallback
- SageShell: IS_TTY now set via explicit check_tty() call with explanatory
  comment; CWD global mutation documented
- scripts/validate.sage: replace dummy stub with real 'test -f' file-
  existence checks so CI catches missing declared files

Structural:
- Remove root sagepkg.sage duplicate; install.sh now installs directly
  from packages/sagepkg/universal/sagepkg.sage
- Introduce lib/json.sage as single canonical source for the JSON library;
  root json.sage and packages copy carry auto-generated-copy headers
- Add 'make sync-deps' target to propagate lib/json.sage to bundled copies
- CI: add sync-verification step to ensure bundled copies match lib/json.sage
- packages.json: bump sagepkg to 1.5.1 (was stale at 1.1.2);
  add architecture list for SageUtils
- packages/sagepkg/metadata.json: bump to 1.5.1
